{
  "Comment": "CloudLab c240g5: 4 -> 8 at 90 s under lazy. Set the rates from the two capacities, as the lab's 2 -> 4 did: Rate about 0.6 x C4 (4to8-calibrate-4), RateSteps 60:about 0.8 x C8 (4to8-calibrate-8), the same in every protocol's file.",
  "WorkDir": "/data-ssd/chenxu/work/wiki-c1024",
  "IndexDir": "/data-ssd/chenxu/work/wiki-c1024/index",
  "EngineBin": "engine/build",
  "GoBin": "bin",
  "Base": "/data-ssd/chenxu/data/wiki-c1024.fbin",
